{"id":"n69638-1-9","stage":5,"title":"위염 · 胃炎","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69638-1-9-1","ko":"음식을 먹으면 속이 거북하고 토할 것 같아요.","zh":"吃了东西之后感觉胃里很不舒服，好像要吐了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음식을","meaning":"食物，食品","explanation":"음식：食物，食品；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"2","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식을","audio":"/audio/9ea9d415f3b4255ca9e5.mp3"}},{"text":"먹으면","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹으면","audio":"/audio/739522170380acf8cc3e.mp3"}},{"text":"속이","meaning":"内脏，心口，肚子","explanation":"속：内脏，心口，肚子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"속","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71278","senseId":"3","lemma":"속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"속이","audio":"/audio/6f6688764f24b1ca69ac.mp3"}},{"text":"거북하고","meaning":"不舒服，不得劲","explanation":"거북하다：不舒服，不得劲；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"거북하다","audio":"/audio/c1c650e6f7ad1ec178f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27304","senseId":"1","lemma":"거북하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거북하고","audio":"/audio/eb6585895f885c1c2e51.mp3"}},{"text":"토할","meaning":"呕吐","explanation":"토하다：呕吐；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"토하다","audio":"/audio/ebede831c778366b736f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49300","senseId":"1","lemma":"토하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"토할","audio":"/audio/5f399747aa0ebc5c54b4.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아요","audio":"/audio/d27f58354e12c6dc5616.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2e144916046c2a6f","term":"음식","zh":"食物，食品","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3","entryId":"71114","definition":"可供人们吃喝的东西。","pronunciation":["음ː식"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"27e1c3f6a82b5a8b","term":"속","zh":"内脏，心口，肚子","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3","entryId":"71278","definition":"人的身体中，腹部的内部或肠胃。","pronunciation":["속ː"]},{"id":"c1c650e6f7ad1ec1","term":"거북하다","zh":"不舒服，不得劲","audio":"/audio/c1c650e6f7ad1ec178f1.mp3","entryId":"27304","definition":"行动或身体机能不自然，或有不适的感觉。","pronunciation":["거ː부카다"]},{"id":"ebede831c778366b","term":"토하다","zh":"呕吐","audio":"/audio/ebede831c778366b736f.mp3","entryId":"49300","definition":"把服下去的食物吐出来。","pronunciation":["토ː하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ea7f16ea7cf3c6f7b1c8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69638-1-9-2","ko":"위염이네요. 약을 지어 드릴게요.","zh":"是胃炎啊。我这就给您开点药。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"위염이네요.","meaning":"胃炎","explanation":"위염：胃炎；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"위염","audio":"/audio/25f98a3cf6275e41a899.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69638","senseId":"1","lemma":"위염","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위염이네요","audio":"/audio/9249d2baf804ed9a2b26.mp3"}},{"text":"약을","meaning":"药","explanation":"약：药；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"약","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72379","senseId":"1","lemma":"약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약을","audio":"/audio/f745a64b3ad605aada03.mp3"}},{"text":"지어","meaning":"配，抓","explanation":"짓다：配，抓；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"짓다","audio":"/audio/e17bf0fed41df779832d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66585","senseId":"2","lemma":"짓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지어","audio":"/audio/828d926a1544943f6448.mp3"}},{"text":"드릴게요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","explanation":"드리다：为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59252","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드릴게요","audio":"/audio/e61f9f5edc04f979cd3a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"25f98a3cf6275e41","term":"위염","zh":"胃炎","audio":"/audio/25f98a3cf6275e41a899.mp3","entryId":"69638","definition":"在胃部产生的炎症；或指因此引发的病。","pronunciation":["위염"]},{"id":"2a9db5dfd1480367","term":"약","zh":"药","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3","entryId":"72379","definition":"为了治疗、预防病患或伤口，服用、抹、注射的物质。","pronunciation":["약"]},{"id":"e17bf0fed41df779","term":"짓다","zh":"配，抓","audio":"/audio/e17bf0fed41df779832d.mp3","entryId":"66585","definition":"用多种材料混合制药。","pronunciation":["짇ː따"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"59252","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/be6fafdc14bebe605502.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.396,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSea